note spec/omegese-om2.md section 2 lines 53-58 (#745): function mode (no fn main) with hex in a const, new length
note and fill, index, while bound and trap code; fnmode-dec.om is the decimal spelling: same bytes.
om2
const KM ulong 0xff
fn f a ulong to ulong
b = new uchar 0x10 0x0
put b 0xf uchar and a KM
k = ulong 0x0
while lt k 0x3 bound 0xa
k = add k 0x1
end
if eq k 0x0
trap 0xd
end
ret add ulong get b 0xf k
end
